        "answer": {
          "short": "$(34,\\ 36,\\ 37.5,\\ 39,\\ 40)$",
          "worked": "The lower half is $34,35,36,36,37$ and the upper half is $38,39,39,39,40$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}Q_1&=36\\\\Q_2&=\\frac{37+38}{2}=37.5\\\\Q_3&=39\\end{aligned}$$\nThe minimum is $34$ and the maximum is $40$. Draw the box from $36$ to $39$, the median at $37.5$, and whiskers to $34$ and $40$.",
